WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.632 --> 00:00:13.541
Roxy gave the squire a suspicious look.

2
00:00:14.101 --> 00:00:15.923
"How did you know I have super powers?"

3
00:00:17.804 --> 00:00:21.047
"My servants told me," the squire said.

4
00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:25.490
"They, um, saw you fight those robbers last night."

5
00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:28.052
"That's odd," Roxy said.

6
00:00:28.073 --> 00:00:30.835
"I didn't see your servants until after the fight."

7
00:00:30.855 --> 00:00:36.819
"Tell me," the squire asked quickly, "does everyone in your world have powers?"

8
00:00:40.883 --> 00:00:42.544
just me," Roxy said.

9
00:00:43.124 --> 00:00:44.545
The squire stroked his chin.

10
00:00:45.346 --> 00:00:47.147
"Very interesting.

11
00:00:47.808 --> 00:00:52.852
You must stay here for a long time—as my guest."

12
00:00:55.994 --> 00:00:57.936
In the morning Wukong woke up and stretched.

13
00:01:01.396 --> 00:01:04.517
Looking down from his ledge, he saw workers cleaning up the mess he'd made.

14
00:01:05.477 --> 00:01:06.498
He could hear them talking.

15
00:01:06.518 --> 00:01:07.858
"What a mess!"

16
00:01:07.878 --> 00:01:10.839
"That monkey smashed a lot of cars!"

17
00:01:10.859 --> 00:01:15.080
"So, those things are called cars," Wukong thought.

18
00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.281
Along the street he saw other cars moving peacefully.

19
00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:22.642
He also noticed that nobody was standing in the middle of the street.

20
00:01:23.422 --> 00:01:24.323
Wukong chuckled.

21
00:01:24.343 --> 00:01:27.303
"I guess the cars weren't trying to attack me.

22
00:01:27.684 --> 00:01:29.044
I was just standing in their way."

23
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.961
Wukong decided to start looking for Bajie.

24
00:01:32.441 --> 00:01:36.083
He flew down to the street and called to a man, "Hello!

25
00:01:36.363 --> 00:01:37.163
What is this place?"

26
00:01:37.183 --> 00:01:38.904
"Don't hurt me!"

27
00:01:39.344 --> 00:01:40.164
The man ran off.

28
00:01:41.605 --> 00:01:45.847
Wukong tried to talk to other people, but everyone was scared of him.

29
00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:50.789
Finally he approached several people in blue uniforms who were helping with the cleanup.

30
00:01:51.669 --> 00:01:53.390
"Detective, there's the monkey!"

31
00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:54.490
one of them cried.

32
00:01:55.651 --> 00:01:58.432
A man in a long coat walked over and puffed out his chest.

33
00:01:59.688 --> 00:02:03.070
"I'm Detective Smith, and you had better not cause any more trouble!"

34
00:02:04.051 --> 00:02:05.031
Wukong laughed.

35
00:02:05.051 --> 00:02:09.134
"Relax! Yesterday was just a big misunderstanding.

36
00:02:09.574 --> 00:02:14.037
I'm looking for a friend who's big and lazy and—" "Where's Rocket Girl?"

37
00:02:14.517 --> 00:02:15.518
Detective Smith asked.

38
00:02:15.538 --> 00:02:18.540
"Oh, don't worry," Wukong said.

39
00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:22.862
"That evil goddess is in another world so she can't harm your kingdom anymore."

40
00:02:24.063 --> 00:02:25.524
Detective Smith's mouth hung open.

41
00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.842
"Rocket Girl isn't evil—she's a hero.

42
00:02:31.063 --> 00:02:35.186
Without her, we'll have all sorts of bad guys running around the city."

43
00:02:35.206 --> 00:02:37.508
"Oops," Wukong thought.

44
00:02:37.528 --> 00:02:39.069
"I guess I made a mistake."

45
00:02:40.069 --> 00:02:41.470
Detective Smith looked concerned.

46
00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:45.113
"How did Rocket Girl wind up in another world?"

47
00:02:45.133 --> 00:02:48.815
"I didn't see it happen," Wukong said with a shrug.

48
00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:51.016
"But I can be your kingdom's new hero.

49
00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:53.958
Take me to your king!"

50
00:02:54.559 --> 00:02:56.040
Detective Smith scratched his head.

51
00:02:57.128 --> 00:03:00.751
"We don't have a king, but I suppose you could talk to Mayor Bloom."

52
00:03:01.872 --> 00:03:05.034
He gave Wukong directions to City Hall, and Wukong hurried off.

53
00:03:10.579 --> 00:03:14.402
"Hello, Mayor Bloom," Wukong said at City Hall.

54
00:03:14.422 --> 00:03:19.006
"I'm Sun Wukong, King of the Fruit and Flower Mountain."

55
00:03:19.026 --> 00:03:23.189
"I've never heard of that place," Mayor Bloom said.

56
00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:26.612
Wukong looked at a picture on the mayor's desk.

57
00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:31.541
"I'm great at destroying demons, so if there's a demon problem, I can handle it."

58
00:03:32.281 --> 00:03:33.562
Mayor Bloom raised an eyebrow.

59
00:03:33.582 --> 00:03:37.143
"We don't have a demon problem in Metro City."

60
00:03:40.023 --> 00:03:41.184
Just then his phone rang.

61
00:03:41.204 --> 00:03:45.465
"Hello? Oh, dear!"

62
00:03:46.645 --> 00:03:47.125
He hung up.

63
00:03:47.145 --> 00:03:51.166
"True Savings Bank is being robbed—I must call Rocket Girl."

64
00:03:51.967 --> 00:03:53.907
The mayor pressed a button on the phone and waited.

65
00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:56.748
When nobody answered, he looked at Wukong.

66
00:03:57.644 --> 00:03:58.606
Wukong grinned.

67
00:03:58.626 --> 00:04:00.268
"Don't worry, Mayor.

68
00:04:00.509 --> 00:04:01.390
I'm on my way!

69
00:04:01.891 --> 00:04:04.114
Just tell me where True Savings Bank is."
